Package: retiremx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: SMTP address migration and routing front end
 retiremx accepts public SMTP connections, rejects retired addresses with
 useful 550 responses, and proxies explicitly permitted transactions to a
 local Postfix SMTP service.
